+/**
+ * WebAuthn / Passkey utility library for The DevTools Times
+ * Provides authentic browser WebAuthn API (navigator.credentials.create & get) integration,
+ * base64url encoding/decoding, PublicKeyCredential serialization, conditional mediation (autofill),
+ * platform authenticator capability checks, and client/server passkey state persistence.
+ */
